WEBVTT

00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:31.768
a few hundred thousand people
took to the streets

00:01:31.792 --> 00:01:35.559
and demonstrations
have continued ever since,

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:39.208
the likes of which
Belarus has never seen before.

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:42.726
All this despite the fact

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:46.393
that the president proclaimed
himself reelected

00:01:46.417 --> 00:01:50.184
and that more than 10,000 people
have been detained,

00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:52.059
hundreds tortured

00:01:52.083 --> 00:01:54.208
and at least six killed.

00:01:55.417 --> 00:02:00.851
Many people wonder why the people
of Belarus are speaking up now.